    "content": "DARRANG COLLEGE (Autonomous)\nTEZPUR-784001, ASSAM\nEst. 1945\nwww.darrangcollege.ac.in\nADMISSION NOTICE (H.S FIRST YEAR 2026)\n(ARTS/SCIENCE/COMMERCE)\nIt is hereby notified that admission to H.S First Year Classes (2026-27) in Arts,\nScience & Commerce will be held according to the timelines notified by ASSEB Div II (N\nOTF./2026/53/2329, Dated 10/04/2026). Notification attached\nThe date of admission to the H.S courses at Darrang College (Autonomous) will be\nnotified shortly.\n1. All original documents must be produced at the time of admission.\n2. Reservation of seats: As per Govt Guidelines\nFor OBC reservation, NCL certificate is compulsory (to be produced at the time\nof Admission).\n3. NCC/Sports/Cultural/PwD/ Ward of Employee Quota: Students who seeks\nadmission in the above categories are to submit all supporting documents with\nDARPAN application form at Principal Office on or before 22nd April, 2026. Only state\nlevel/national & international level prize winning students will be considered for sports\nand cultural quota.\n4. Fees Structure: To be notified after approval from Govt. of Assam\n5. Fees Waiver Scheme: To be notified if approved by Govt. of Assam\nDr. Palash Moni Saikia\nPrincipal\nDarrang College (Autonomous)\nAccredited by NAAC\nGrade B++ (Cycle 4) with\nCGPA 2.85\nAISHE ID: C - 17319\n\n-- 3 of 3 --"
